{"op": "append", "content": "[\u26a0\ufe0f] [2026-01-23 05:14:00 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-CodeAudit] [Project: scribe_codebase_audit] Pattern identified - validation functions are MASSIVE across tools (346 lines in query_entries, likely similar in append_entry) | confidence=0.9; examples={\"append_entry\": \"_validate_and_prepare_parameters (246 lines)\", \"query_entries\": \"_validate_search_parameters (346 lines)\"}; issue_type=validation_complexity; pattern=massive_validation_functions; reasoning={\"how\": \"Analyzed function structures - validation functions dominate tool complexity and follow identical patterns\", \"what\": \"Every major tool has 200-400 line validation function with similar patterns: parameter normalization, type checking, config merging, defaults\", \"why\": \"Validation logic is duplicated pattern across tools and should be extracted to shared validation framework\"}; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_codebase_audit/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-23T05:14:00.588619+00:00_e1029f78", "timestamp": "2026-01-23T05:14:00.588655+00:00"}
