{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-23 05:15:09 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Security] [Project: scribe_codebase_audit] delete_project Security Analysis: GOOD protections found. (1) Requires explicit confirm=True (line 86), (2) Root path validation - must match project's repo_root (lines 103-111), (3) Uses shutil.rmtree for directory deletion with path derived from project record not user input (line 163). (4) archive_path parameter is user-controlled but only used for destination, not deletion source. LOW RISK: archive_path could be abused to write to unintended locations if not validated. | area=file_operations; confidence=0.9; files_examined=[\"tools/delete_project.py\"]; reasoning={\"how\": \"Traced delete flow from input through validation to shutil.rmtree call, verified path sources\", \"what\": \"Found confirmation requirement, root validation, and deletion paths derived from internal records not user input. archive_path is user-controlled destination only.\", \"why\": \"Delete operations are high-risk - must verify proper authorization and path validation\"}; severity=LOW; stage=research; task=security_audit; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_codebase_audit/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-23T05:15:09.477432+00:00_9978f0ff", "timestamp": "2026-01-23T05:15:09.477476+00:00"}
