{"op": "append", "content": "[\u26a0\ufe0f] [2026-01-23 05:26:12 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-StateAudit] [Project: scribe_codebase_audit] Found critical data structures ONLY in state.json: current_project (global default), agent_state (custom agent data). These have NO SQLite equivalent. | confidence=1; reasoning={\"how\": \"Searched SQLite schema for equivalents, found agent_projects table tracks per-agent but no global current_project. Verified with grep searches.\", \"what\": \"current_project: global fallback project (distinct from per-agent agent_projects table). agent_state: arbitrary agent metadata storage (no schema in SQLite). Constraint: Eliminating state.json would require migrating these to SQLite with new tables/columns.\", \"why\": \"Need to identify which state.json data is truly unique and cannot be eliminated\"}; unique_to_state_json=[\"current_project\", \"agent_state\"]; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_codebase_audit/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-23T05:26:12.282180+00:00_9ad7b5fe", "timestamp": "2026-01-23T05:26:12.282224+00:00"}
