s/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_codebase_audit/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-23T05:34:44.103862+00:00_4fd2ce2d", "timestamp": "2026-01-23T05:34:44.103899+00:00"}
