{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-23 05:36:14 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Formatter] [Project: scribe_codebase_audit] Investigation phase complete. Gathered comprehensive data: 1) Complete method inventory (33 methods + 6 module functions), 2) Domain clustering (7 clear domains identified), 3) Dependency graph (4-tier hierarchy, no circular deps), 4) Tool coupling analysis (8 tools affected), 5) Test coverage assessment (2 test files, 57KB), 6) Constants categorization (4 categories of shared constants). Ready to synthesize decomposition strategy with module structure, extraction order, migration approach, and risk assessment. | confidence=0.95; data_points_collected=6; methods_analyzed=39; reasoning={\"how\": \"Systematic investigation using scribe.read_file for code inspection, bash for dependency discovery, grep for coupling analysis. All findings verified with file:line references\", \"what\": \"Collected all required data points: method inventory with line ranges and signatures, domain clusters with method counts, dependency tiers with call graph, external dependencies (8 tools), test coverage metrics, constant locations. Have quantitative basis for decomposition strategy. Constraint: must design backwards-compatible migration to avoid breaking 8 tools and 2 test files simultaneously\", \"why\": \"Confirm investigation completeness before document creation\"}; test_files=2; tools_affected=8; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_codebase_audit/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-23T05:36:14.842637+00:00_e4690758", "timestamp": "2026-01-23T05:36:14.842687+00:00"}
