{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-23 05:36:31 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Reminders] [Project: scribe_codebase_audit] Token efficiency analysis: Avg full template 82.5 chars, short template 39.1 chars (52.6% reduction). Max 3 reminders/call = ~120-250 chars overhead (30-60 tokens est). Short templates used by default (config: use_short_templates=true). Tool-specific limits minimize noise (append_entry max 1 reminder). Compact mode threshold: 3 reminders. Token overhead is MINIMAL and well-optimized - not a performance concern. | avg_full_chars=82.5; avg_short_chars=39.1; confidence=0.95; max_overhead_tokens=60; optimization_verdict=well_optimized; reasoning={\"how\": \"Calculated template sizes, analyzed config defaults, estimated token overhead\", \"what\": \"Short templates save 52.6% chars. Max overhead: ~30-60 tokens per call. Default behavior uses short templates. Tool limits prevent spam. Compact mode activates at 3+ reminders.\", \"why\": \"Assess if reminders add excessive token overhead to responses\"}; token_savings_pct=52.6; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_codebase_audit/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-23T05:36:31.595915+00:00_b435303b", "timestamp": "2026-01-23T05:36:31.595959+00:00"}
