{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-23 05:43:41 UTC] [Agent: ArchitectAgent-Cleanup] [Project: scribe_codebase_audit] Beginning architecture synthesis for Scribe codebase cleanup project. Analyzed 10 research documents: 3 substantive (RESEARCH_PERFORMANCE_AUDIT.md, RESEARCH_DATABASE_OPTIMIZATION.md, RESEARCH_REMINDER_SYSTEM.md), 7 empty templates. Key findings to synthesize: (1) CRITICAL: No connection pooling in SQLite - 50-80% latency improvement opportunity (2) CRITICAL: state.json dual-write pattern needs elimination (3) HIGH: Missing indexes on agent/emoji columns (4) MEDIUM: ResponseFormatter god class needs decomposition (5) POSITIVE: Reminder system is production-ready - NO changes needed. Architecture mode: Updating existing root documents (not sub-plan) since this is a comprehensive cleanup covering entire codebase. | critical_findings=[\"no_connection_pooling\", \"state_json_dual_write\"]; empty_templates=7; high_findings=[\"missing_indexes\", \"formatter_god_class\"]; phase=synthesis; positive_findings=[\"reminder_system_production_ready\"]; reasoning={\"how\": \"Reading all research docs via read_file, analyzing findings by severity, creating 6-phase plan based on impact/effort ratio\", \"what\": \"10 research docs reviewed, 3 contained detailed findings, mode is root-doc update (comprehensive cleanup), reminder system explicitly excluded from changes\", \"why\": \"Synthesize research into actionable cleanup phases prioritized by Security > Performance > Maintainability\"}; research_docs_analyzed=10; substantive_docs=3; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_codebase_audit/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-23T05:43:41.620317+00:00_f4202ccf", "timestamp": "2026-01-23T05:43:41.620360+00:00"}
