{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-23 05:59:13 UTC] [Agent: CoderAgent-Phase1] [Project: scribe_codebase_audit] Starting Phase 1 Task 1: Adding 4 missing database indexes to eliminate full table scans. Will modify storage/sqlite.py _initialise() method to add: (1) idx_entries_agent_ts, (2) idx_entries_emoji_ts, (3) idx_entries_logtype_ts, (4) idx_projects_repo | files_to_modify=[\"storage/sqlite.py\"]; phase=1; reasoning={\"how\": \"Add _ensure_index() calls to _initialise() method following existing pattern, grouped together for clarity\", \"what\": \"4 indexes covering agent queries, emoji filtering, log_type filtering, and repo_root lookups. Research showed these are high-frequency operations currently doing full scans.\", \"why\": \"Eliminate full table scans identified in research phase that cause performance issues on large databases\"}; task=1.1-1.3b; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_codebase_audit/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-23T05:59:13.111615+00:00_7331407f", "timestamp": "2026-01-23T05:59:13.111655+00:00"}
