{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-23 08:31:19 UTC] [Agent: CoderAgent-Phase6-LazyJournal] [Project: scribe_codebase_audit] Phase 6 Task 6.1 COMPLETE: Lazy Journal Replay implementation successful. Created _replay_journals_background() function (83 lines) that moves journal replay to a background task. Updated _startup() to use schedule_background_task() for non-blocking startup. Added _journal_replay_complete tracking flag. Fixed missing agent parameter in list_projects call. Server now starts immediately and responds to tool calls while journals replay in background. All 28 dispatcher tests pass. Implementation report created at IMPLEMENTATION_REPORT_20260123_0830.md. Confidence: 0.95. | confidence=0.95; files_modified=[\"server.py\"]; implementation_report=IMPLEMENTATION_REPORT_20260123_0830.md; phase=6; reasoning={\"how\": \"Created _replay_journals_background() function, added tracking flag, replaced 72 lines of inline code with background task call, fixed agent parameter\", \"what\": \"Moved all journal replay logic to background async function, uses existing schedule_background_task infrastructure\", \"why\": \"Server startup was blocked by journal replay - users had to wait before tools worked\"}; task=6.1; tests_passed=28; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_codebase_audit/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-23T08:31:19.158127+00:00_08068158", "timestamp": "2026-01-23T08:31:19.158165+00:00"}
